https://adamtheising.github.io/Papers/theising_avgas_7-21.pdf (“Being most frequently 
downwind of airports, residents in these block groups will bear the heaviest brunt of local 
pollution exposure.  Results from this model are striking: block groups within 1km of an airport 
that receive heavy wind have 9% lower median incomes and have a roughly 3% higher black 
