Association of Environmental and Resource Economists. 4(2):575-610. 
5 Miranda et. al., 2011. A Geospatial Analysis of the Effects of Aviation Gasoline on Childhood Blood Lead Levels. 
Environmental Health Perspectives. 119:1513–1516."
