Certificate (STC) | Experimental Aircraft Association (EAA). The first pilot to 
legally fly in an aircraft with automobile gasoline was then-FAA Administrator J. 
Lynn Helms [Wikipedia]. Since then, more than 24,000 STCs have been issued 
by EAA. 
