In addition to having a disproportionate impact on OBCs in New Jersey and 
Environmental Justice Communities around the U.S., lead poisoning has severe impacts on 
children—especially children in OBCs.  On July 28, 2022, the Subcommittee on Environment of 
the Committee on Oversight and Reform within the U.S. House of Representatives (the 
