2018-12/documents/fedactionplan_lead_final.pdf. 
16 Sammy Zahran et al., Leaded Aviation Gasoline Exposure Risk and Child Blood Lead Levels, 2 PNAS Nexus 1, 2, 
5-6 (2023), https://academic.oup.com/pnasnexus/article/2/1/pgac285/6979725. 
17 Id. at 3, 5.  
