IV. 
An endangerment finding for avgas is warranted 
 
EPA’s notice of proposed rulemaking, and its underlying evidence, plainly 
establishes that avgas “causes or contributes to[] air pollution which may reasonably be 
anticipated to endanger public health or welfare.”37 Accordingly, an endangerment finding 
for avgas is both necessary and justified. 
 
